     * editor as `passwordMetaId` (`passwords_group_panel.dart:106`) and resolves the save against
     * it (`_resolveMetaId`, `password_editor_panel.dart:608`), rather than re-deriving it from
     * (site, account) -- account is an editable field, so re-deriving it after an account change
     * finds nothing and writes a second metadata record, orphaning the first.
