        /**
         * How many tasks the runtimes are carrying, for the app's usage log.
         *
         * A session, a call or a relay link that is not torn down leaves its tasks behind, and a parked
         * task costs no CPU to speak of -- so nothing else measured about this process would show it. The
         * count going up call after call and never coming back down is that leak, visible. Both runtimes,
         * because work lands on either depending on who spawned it. Async only so that the second one can
