        /**
         * Joins the iCloud Keychain circle with the previous device vouching for this one. True if it
         * joined. Not from BB: it belongs to the sign-in that carries an account over a change of device
         * (`login.rs`, `set_aside_account`), which has neither of the things a circle is otherwise set up
         * from -- no two-factor circle session, no nearby Apple device.
         *
         * What it has is the old device's own circle identity, saved with the account and held in memory
         * since the sign-in. `join_clique_with` makes this device a new identity, has the old one sign a
