         * The account is deleted from this device either way ([reset_user]); its continuation key is no
         * use here once the device is gone. Deleting it in the same call as setting it aside is also what
         * makes a second call safe. The settings-side device swap calls this itself, writes the new device
         * over `hw_info.plist`, and then resets the session, which calls this again: with the account
